oring SftpRegexPatternFileListFilterTest**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Implementing DirEntry helper and regex tests**\"}]}"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_Jy61irRjMdKdDGGPWRKssmeB|fc_0df12a75a25775e3016aa22446358487d28e07f9c36cf09f3a", "name": "write", "arguments": {"path": "tests/src/org.springframework.integration/spring-integration-sftp/7.1.1/src/test/java/org_springframework_integration/spring_integration_sftp/Spring_integration_sftpTest.java", "content": "/*\n * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n *\n * You should have received a copy of the CC0 legalcode along with this\n * work. If not, see <http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>.\n */\npackage org_springframework_integration.spring_integration_sftp;\n\nimport org.apache.sshd.sftp.client.SftpClient;\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\n\nimport org.springframework.integration.sftp.filters.SftpRegexPatternFileListFilter;\nimport org.springframework.integration.sftp.filters.SftpSimplePatternFileListFilter;\n\nimport static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n\npublic class Spring_integration_sftpTest {\n\n    @Test\n    void regexFilterAcceptsOnlyMatchingRemoteFiles() {\n        SftpRegexPatternFileListFilter filter = new SftpRegexPatternFileListFilter(\"report-\\\\d+\\\\.csv\");\n\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"report-2025.csv\"))).isTrue();\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"report-final.csv\"))).isFalse();\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"report-2025.txt\"))).isFalse();\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    void simplePatternFilterUsesWildcardForRemoteFiles() {\n        SftpSimplePatternFileListFilter filter = new SftpSimplePatternFileListFilter(\"*.json\");\n\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"manifest.json\"))).isTrue();\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"manifest.json.bak\"))).isFalse();\n        assertThat(filter.accept(entry(\"manifest.yaml\"))).isFalse();\n    }\n\n    private static SftpClient.DirEntry entry(String filename) {\n        return new SftpClient.DirEntry(filename, filename, new SftpClient.Attributes());\n    }\n\n}\n"}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "usage": {"input": 1894, "output": 811, "cacheRead": 103936, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 352, "totalTokens": 106641, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1789011005285, "responseId": "resp_0df12a75a25775e3016aa2243d77c487d2a06d85fb89d2c147", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_Jy61irRjMdKdDGGPWRKssmeB|fc_0df12a75a25775e3016aa22446358487d28e07f9c36cf09f3a", "toolName": "write", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully wrote 1561 bytes to tests/src/org.springframework.integration/spring-integration-sftp/7.1.1/src/test/java/org_springframework_integration/spring_integration_sftp/Spring_integration_sftpTest.java"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1789011022228}]}
